.TH geectl-local-build-service-run 1  "geectl-local-build-service-run 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-local\-build\-service\-run \- Run the `_service` file\*(Aqs services in the container, filtered by the run mode
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl local\-build service\-run\fR [\fB\-\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-service\fR] [\fB\-\-timeout\-secs\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIDIRECTORY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the `_service` file\*(Aqs services in the container, filtered by the run mode
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR \fI<MODE>\fR [default: run]
The run mode: run, manualrun, precommit, localrun, disabledrun
.TP
\fB\-\-service\fR \fI<SERVICE>\fR
Run only this service, with the run mode forced as its mode
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\-secs\fR \fI<TIMEOUT_SECS>\fR [default: 3600]
Timeout in seconds for the whole run
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIDIRECTORY\fR>
The source directory carrying the `_service` file
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
